      "dcterms:abstract": "periods” admitting an explicit description by generators and relations. We establish comparison theorems relating this new Weil cohomology to the classical ones: Berthelot’s rigid cohomology and the ℓ-adic cohomologies, for ℓ̸ = p. We also state some conjectures on the ring AK. One of these conjectures implies the independence of ℓin cohomology.",
