      "dcterms:abstract": "Article history: In 2012, Andrews and Merca proved a truncated theorem on Received 27 December 2023 Euler’s pentagonal number theorem. Their work has opened Accepted 29 March 2024 . : . up a new study of truncated series. Recently, Ballantine and Available online 15 April 2024 . y Merca posed a conjecture on infinite families of inequalities involving be (n), which counts the number of 6-regular partitions",
