      "dcterms:abstract": "We develop a diagrammatic formalism for calculating the Alexander polynomial of the closure of a braid as a state-sum. Our main tools are the Markov trace formulas for the HOMFLY-PT polynomial and Young’s semi-normal repre- sentations of the Iwahori-Hecke algebras of type A.",
