    {
      "@id": "references/arxiv-q-alg-9504020v1",
      "@type": [
        "fabio:Work",
        "bibo:AcademicArticle"
      ],
      "dcterms:title": "A link invariant from quantum dilogarithm",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "Kashaev∗, R.M."
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20181108",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/q-alg/9504020",
      "dcterms:abstract": "The link invariant, arising from the cyclic quantum dilogarithm via the particular R-matrix construction, is proved to coincide with the invariant of triangulated links in S3 introduced in [14]. The obtained invariant, like Alexander-Conway polynomial, vanishes on disjoint union of links. The R-matrix can be considered as the cyclic analog of the universal R-matrix associated with Uq(sl(2)) algebra. ENSLAPP-L-517/95 ∗On leave from St. Petersburg Branch of the Steklov Mathematical Institute, Fontanka 27, St. Petersburg 191011, RUSSIA †URA 14-36 du CNRS, associ´ee `a l’E.N.S. de Lyon, et `a l’Universit`e de Savoie",
      "dcterms:source": "library/arxiv-q-alg-9504020v1/manifest.jsonld",
      "dcterms:hasVersion": "library/arxiv-q-alg-9504020v1"
    },
    {
      "@id": "references/arxiv-q-alg-9601025v2",
      "@type": [
        "fabio:Work",
        "bibo:AcademicArticle"
      ],
      "dcterms:title": "The hyperbolic volume of knots from the quantum dilogarithm",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "Kashaev∗, R.M."
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20181106",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/q-alg/9601025",
      "dcterms:abstract": "The invariant of a link in three-sphere, associated with the cyclic quantum dilogarithm, depends on a natural number N. By the analysis of particular examples it is argued that for a hyperbolic knot (link) the absolute value of this invariant grows exponentially at large N, the hyperbolic volume of the knot (link) complement being the growth rate. ENSLAPP-L-577/96 ∗On leave of absence from St. Petersburg Branch of the Steklov Mathematical Institute, Fontanka 27, St. Petersburg 191011, RUSSIA †URA 14-36 du CNRS, associ´ee `a l’E.N.S. de Lyon, au LAPP d’Annecy et `a l’Universit`e de Savoie 1",
      "dcterms:source": "library/arxiv-q-alg-9601025v2/manifest.jsonld",
      "dcterms:hasVersion": "library/arxiv-q-alg-9601025v2"
    },
