        "Jr.2b, Samuel J. Lomonaco"
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20160327",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1603.07827",
      "dcterms:abstract": "This paper is an introduction to relationships between topology, quantum computing and the properties of fermions. In particular we study the remarkable unitary braid group representations associated with Majorana fermions.",
      "dcterms:source": "library/arxiv-1603.07827v1/manifest.jsonld",
