      "@id": "references/arxiv-2006.02042v1",
      "@type": [
        "fabio:Work",
        "bibo:AcademicArticle"
      ],
      "dcterms:title": "The Strong AJ Conjecture for the Figure 8 Knot",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "NGUYEN, HOANG-AN",
        "TRAN, ANH T."
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20220307",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.02042",
      "dcterms:abstract": "Motivated by the theory of quantum A-ideals of Frohman-Gelca-LoFaro, the theory of q-holonomicity of quantum invariants of Garoufalidis-Le and the AJ conjecture of Garoufalidis, Sikora formulated the strong AJ conjecture which relates the A-ideal and recurrence ideal of a knot in the 3-sphere. This conjecture has been veriﬁed for all torus knots and most of their cables. In this paper, we verify the strong AJ conjecture for the ﬁgure eight knot.",
      "dcterms:source": "library/arxiv-2006.02042v1/manifest.jsonld",
