      "dcterms:abstract": "We review some applications of Gr¨obner-Shirshov bases, including PBW the- orems, linear bases of free universal algebras, normal forms for groups and semigroups, extensions of groups and algebras, embedding of algebras.",
      "dcterms:source": "library/arxiv-1502.06472v1/manifest.jsonld",
