      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1006.1099",
      "dcterms:abstract": "There is a classical relationship in algebraic geometry between a hyperelliptic curve and an associated pencil of quadric hypersurfaces. We investigate symplectic aspects of this relationship, with a view to applications in low-dimensional topology.",
